// ATT&CK: privilege-escalation, stealth
// Description: Detects the creation of the LiveKD driver, which is used for live kernel debugging
// False positives:
//   - Legitimate usage of LiveKD for debugging purposes will also trigger this
// References:
//   - Internal Research
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/a493c320d560f387b4782c209780a7c928267300/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_sysinternals_livekd_driver.yml
